 masking, forward, and scoring methods.\"}","mechanism":"Compare the content-conditioned causal gate in model.py with the unchanged incumbent and the parameter-matched static-gate control in control-1.py. Only the candidate gate receives the block activation as input.","predicted_observations":["The candidate and control reproduce the incumbent block output at initialization because each gate starts at one.","After learning, the candidate gate varies with activation content; the control gate cannot vary with that content.","A useful content-conditioned response would produce a four-category mean HR@10 above 0.59975 and above the matched control mean. Category effects remain uncertain."]},"design_hash":"c0851677c19b09672e38b4fc28b52094783c5196488c6f1d7545caae346be913","mechanism_status":"unknown","next_step":"Assess whether the implemented contrast isolates the proposed mechanism; design a discriminating follow-up for competing explanations.","qualification":"Paired development observation, not causal proof or independent replication.","slices":[{"candidate_minus_control":0.0010000000000000009,"dataset":"Movies_and_TV","seed":42},{"candidate_minus_control":0.009000000000000008,"dataset":"Industrial_and_Scientific","seed":42},{"candidate_minus_control":0.01899999999999996,"dataset":"Electronics","seed":42},{"candidate_minus_control":-0.0010000000000000009,"dataset":"CDs_and_Vinyl","seed":42}],"source_hashes":{"amazon-next-v8-round-1-control-1":"476ecc734dcc059fbdde19e242248321ba093c766b8f3091c30fd7a3b7580e8e","amazon-next-v9-round-6-control-1":"fcabc46174c42c5c22bd8042df714fae1c93d6edb690dc2ba9255e61a0fe9f1b","amazon-next-v9-round-6-model":"9c6863a3f90813975d60badcc820bf87dba29401cb106a19364d7af3427b63d5"}}],"metric":"HR@10","minimum_effect":0,"model_minus_baseline":{"amazon-next-v9-round-6-control-1":-0.011749999999999927,"amazon-next-v9-round-6-model":-0.004749999999999921},"promotion_order":[],"protocol_minimum_effect":0.005,"qualification":"Performance selection i